<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Last Updated: {{ date }}</p>

<h3>Intro & Scope</h3>
<p>
  This privacy notice describes how your information (phone number, message contents and timestamps) are stored when you use our service.
  We (the maintainers of this service) use Twilio, a cloud communication platform, that allows
  you (the user) to send and receive SMS text messages. Twilio records message data from every phone number
  that interacts with this service for 14 days. 
</p>

<h3>How your data is used</h3>
<p>
  Data shall be used for debugging and development purposes only. Outside of Twilio logging, we do not retain 
  any information or data. We will not sell, replicate or distribute any information we collect within Twilio message logs.
</p>